      "text": "13× more for the same money each year",
      "value": 13,
      "unit": "× per year",
      "basis": "Epoch AI: the cost of achieving a given level of AI performance has fallen about 47% per quarter since 2023, or 13× per year, across five benchmarks. 13× cheaper is 13× more per unit of money, in any currency."
    },
    "caption": "Since 2023, the cost of a given level of AI performance has fallen about 47% per quarter, so the same money buys roughly 13× more each year (average of five benchmarks). The chart shows one of them: one US dollar bought about 3 GPQA Diamond questions at a 75% score in January 2025 and about 2,400 in July 2026, 725 times as many.",
